@startuml 03_constraints
/'
MÔ TẢ SƠ ĐỒ
Mục tiêu: Mô hình hóa các Component thực thi kiểm tra Ràng buộc (Constraints Validation Pipeline).
Phạm vi: Các Checker Component riêng biệt được Engine gọi trong vòng lặp CSP.
Assumptions:
- Tách biệt Hard Constraints (trả rề False nếu vi phạm) và Soft Constraints (trả về Negative Score/Penalty).
'/

title Component Diagram - Constraints Evaluation Pipeline

package "CSP Core Engine" {
  [Backtracking Solver] as Search
}

package "Constraint Evaluators (Strategy Pattern)" {
  
  interface "SystemConstraint" as IConstraint
  
  package "Hard Constraints (Must Pass)" {
    [Teacher Conflict Checker] as TC
    [Room Conflict Checker] as RC
    [Room Capacity Validator] as CapC
    [Time Rule (TT29) Validator] as TimeC
  }
  
  package "Soft Constraints (Scoring)" {
    [Soft Constraint Scorer] as Scorer
    [Consecutive Session Analyzer] as CSA
    [Gap Minimizer Penalty] as GapP
  }
}

Search --> IConstraint : calls `.evaluate(assignment)`

IConstraint <|-- TC
IConstraint <|-- RC
IConstraint <|-- CapC
IConstraint <|-- TimeC

IConstraint <|-- Scorer
Scorer *-- CSA : internal
Scorer *-- GapP : internal

note top of Scorer
  Không block assignment, 
  nhưng trả về Heuristic Score âm 
  nếu vi phạm.
end note

note bottom of TimeC
  Đảm bảo EndTime(Session) <= 22:00
end note

@enduml
